      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullaunnasmear is an old stone built two storey farmhouse cottage located at the foot of the Blackstairs mountains and accessed by a shared driveway. \nDownstairs there is a separate living room on the left and an open plan kitchen dining room on the right with stairs leading to the second floor. Upstairs there are two further bedrooms.\nThere is a old stone shed for storage located at the front of the property.\n \nThis Property is in need of complete refurbishment throughout including services to be installed.\n \nMay qualify for the derelict or vacant homes grant, subject to approval. \n"
      },
